# ⚡ Day 42 / 50 — Energy Domain Challenge (SQL + Power BI)

## 📌 Problem Statement
Working as a **Data Analyst at an Energy Company** to analyze electricity consumption,
revenue, and customer behavior to **optimize energy distribution** and **increase profitability**.

---

## 🗂️ Deliverables

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `Day42_Energy_SQL.sql` | Complete MySQL script — DDL, DML, all queries |
| `Day42_Energy_Analysis.xlsx` | 4-sheet Excel workbook with charts & KPI dashboard |
| `Day42_Energy_Dashboard.html` | Interactive Power BI-equivalent dashboard (Chart.js) |

---

## 📊 Dataset Overview

| Attribute | Details |
|-----------|---------|
| Records | 10 Customers |
| Date Range | Jan 01–10, 2024 |
| Regions | North, South, East, West |
| Energy Sources | Solar, Coal, Wind, Hydro |
| Payment Statuses | Paid (6), Pending (4) |

---

## 🔑 Key KPIs

| KPI | Value |
|-----|-------|
| Total Consumption | **2,700 kWh** |
| Total Revenue | **₹31,700** |
| Pending Payments | **4 customers** |
| Avg Consumption | **270 kWh** |
| Revenue at Risk | **₹16,700 (52.68%)** |

---

## 📍 SQL Queries Covered

### Basic Analysis
- Total electricity consumption
- Total revenue generated

### Group By Analysis
- Consumption by Region
- Revenue by Energy Source

### Business Questions
- Highest consuming region
- Pending payment count & revenue at risk
- Average billing per customer
- Top 3 customers by consumption
- Payment status revenue split

### Advanced Analysis
- Revenue per kWh (source efficiency)
- Region-wise payment recovery rate
- Consumption trend with running total (Window Function)
- Customer ranking within region (RANK + PARTITION BY)

---

## 📈 Business Insights

1. 🔴 **North** is the highest consuming region (950 kWh, 35.19%)
2. 💰 **Coal** generates maximum revenue (₹13,500, 42.59%)
3. ⏳ **52.68%** of revenue is stuck in pending payments (₹16,700)
4. 🎯 **Payment recovery priority**: Customer 110 > 105 > 102 > 107
5. 📈 **Consumption trend**: Volatile (120→500 kWh), peaking on Jan 10
6. ✅ **Wind energy** has best revenue/kWh ratio (₹12.14) — expand for margins

